'''''Chara canescens''''' is a species of [[stonewort]] belonging to the family [[Characeae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web|title=Chara canescens Loisel.|url=https://www.gbif.org/species/5270837|website=www.gbif.org|access-date=14 February 2021|language=en}}</ref>

Its native range is Europe and Northern America.<ref name="GBIF" /> It is described as a brackish water species,<ref>Werner Krause, [[Hanuš Ettl]], Georg Gärtner, H. Heynig, [[Dieter Mollenhauer|D. Mollenhauer]]: ''Süsswasserflora von Mitteleuropa. Band 18: Charales (Charophyceae)''. – Gustav Fischer Verlag, 1997. ISBN 3-437-25056-6</ref> but can also be found in a few inland lakes.<ref>Korte et al. 2010 https://publikationen.ub.uni-frankfurt.de/opus4/frontdoor/deliver/index/docId/25367/file/Korte_et_al_2010_Chara.pdf</ref><ref>Arbeitsgruppe Characeen Deutschlands (2015) Armleuchteralgen: Die Characeen Deutschlands. Springer Spektrum, ISBN 978-3-662-477-97-7</ref>

